        <body>
            <div xml:id="d398">

                <pb facs="0735" n="641" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg641"/>

                <head>No. 393.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Stallo.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-11-07"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 7,
                        1887</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 81.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I transmit for your information a copy of a
                    letter of 31st January last, to Mr. Patrick Dwyer, touching the suggested
                    presentation of a memotial from creditors of Archibishop of purcell to His
                    Holiness the Pope.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. P. Bayard.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d398-a1.xml" xpointer="d398-a1"/>
